# item61b (times shifted +8.5 s for the item64 grapple route): the route player SURVIVES the tarmac (normal-health soldiers; item61) and the
# game's TouchTrigger10.Touch fired at 325.017 while TT10 is still disarmed (the generator
# chain is blocked; pinned in the test). The route continues by player input:
#
# 1. Fight (labelled M60 grant): the fresh import carries only Fists (GameInfo.AcceptInventory
#    grants no weapon on a campaign map without travel data), so the route grants the M60
#    through the game's own Weapon.GiveTo/BringUp - the item14 diagnostic bootstrap, the same
#    grant the item53b spec sanctioned ("the M60 or a weapon the level gives"; the level has
#    only ammo clips: 2x bmg50AmmoClip, PumpAmmoClip, BazookAmmoClip - no weapon pickup).
#    BaseSoldier18 (Tag bataillefinale, authored 150 hp, Skill 2, bAlerte) stands on the
#    lower road at (17807,1438); track him and fire from behind the Tmetaldoorhelico door
#    line, crouching between bursts (cover).
t=341.50 weapon XIII.m60
